# Only documents that explain the code or the repository are published.
# Reports, summaries and analyses stay local: they quote benchmark content, name
# specific annotation defects in third-party datasets, and carry comparisons
# against other groups' systems. Code, scripts and tests remain tracked so the
# work is still reproducible.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/DESIGN.md
!/EXPERIMENT_ENV.md
docs/
scratchpad/*.md
